00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,640
No, Tristan!

249
00:14:25,500 --> 00:14:29,240
I could have protected her without
losing points, you show off.

250
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:32,817
Hey, just back off, you're no help.

251
00:14:32,900 --> 00:14:35,488
Oh, we have to play
smart or we'll all lose.

252
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:41,440
Now I activate Card of Sanctity, requiring
all of us to draw from our decks.

253
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:44,880
Don't stop until you have
six cards in your hand.

254
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:49,068
Think of it as recharging your
batteries to refresh the game.

255
00:14:49,540 --> 00:14:50,370
You done?

256
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:53,240
Yeah, can we go now? Not yet. Next,

257
00:14:53,380 --> 00:14:58,321
I'll dispose of three machine monsters to
activate my Deck Master's special ability,

258
00:14:58,620 --> 00:14:59,740
Final Artillery.

259
00:15:02,900 --> 00:15:06,080
Say goodbye to 500 more life points each.

260
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:08,580
Soon you'll all be obsolete.

261
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:13,820
Now I'll place this face
down and end my turn.

262
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:15,600
Now I'm ready.

263
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,660
Here goes.

264
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:21,780
I play Lady Panther in defense mode.

265
00:15:23,060 --> 00:15:27,300
Then I'll switch the Forgiving
Maiden from attack to defense mode.

266
00:15:28,300 --> 00:15:29,697
You go, girl.

267
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:30,720
All right.

268
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:35,080
Now I summon Command Angel
to the field in defense mode.

269
00:15:36,260 --> 00:15:37,800
We're on a roll now.

270
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:41,760
I summon forth my Dark
Assailant in defense mode.

271
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:44,717
Looks like you've lined up
your monsters for me to knock

272
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:48,520
down one by one as I move closer
to disassembling you three.

273
00:15:51,780 --> 00:15:53,560
All right, you rust bucket.

274
00:15:53,820 --> 00:15:56,537
You'll never get past our
army of defensive monsters,

275
00:15:56,620 --> 00:15:59,620
and I dare you to attack
us directly again.

276
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:02,220
Quit flapping your lips.

277
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:04,478
We don't need to give him any ideas.

278
00:16:04,620 --> 00:16:05,577
Don't worry, Tristan.

279
00:16:05,660 --> 00:16:09,297
He doesn't have enough cards left to
activate his Deckmaster ability again.

280
00:16:09,380 --> 00:16:11,027
So our life points are safe.

281
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:15,460
Almost correct, but you've
forgotten about my trap card. No!

282
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:19,680
I activate Backup Soldier.

283
00:16:20,300 --> 00:16:21,980
Oh no, what's that?

284
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:25,438
Since I have more than five
monsters in my graveyard,

285
00:16:25,740 --> 00:16:29,505
this trap card allows me to bring
three of them back to my hand.

286
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:34,940
So, it looks like I'll be able to
activate my Deckmaster ability after all.

287
00:16:35,380 --> 00:16:37,997
Now I'll take the three monsters I've just

288
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:40,904
received and deposit them
back to the graveyard.

289
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:45,660
Thus activating my special
ability, Final Artillery.

290
00:16:48,660 --> 00:16:52,060
Show some originality and
do something new for once.

291
00:16:52,300 --> 00:16:54,280
Why change a good thing? Attack!

292
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:59,880
Reliability is the key to a good invention

293
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:03,160
He's too strong Affirmative,

294
00:17:03,340 --> 00:17:06,237
but you've only seen a small
sample of my overall strength

295
00:17:06,320 --> 00:17:09,877
What you're about to experience
will blow your circuits

296
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:14,277
Meet Clockwork Knight This
magic card has the power to

297
00:17:14,360 --> 00:17:19,620
transform all of your monsters
into machines Say what? No way,

298
00:17:19,820 --> 00:17:22,957
man And in addition to
turning your creatures

299
00:17:23,040 --> 00:17:26,480
into metal They'll each
lose 500 attack points.

300
00:17:29,040 --> 00:17:30,320
And don't forget,

301
00:17:30,740 --> 00:17:35,680
my Machine King gets an additional 100
points for every machine monster in play,

302
00:17:35,920 --> 00:17:37,220
and I count six.

303
00:17:38,020 --> 00:17:42,500
Finally, Clockwork Knight gives
my Machine King 500 extra points.

304
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:44,480
Nesbitt can't be stopped now.

305
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:45,718
Chill out, Tristan.

306
00:17:45,940 --> 00:17:47,417
Everything's under control.

307
00:17:47,500 --> 00:17:49,717
Our monsters are in
defense mode, remember?

308
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:52,637
If we keep cool, that pile
of scrap can't hurt us.

309
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:55,940
You must grow tired of
being wrong all the time.

310
00:17:56,520 --> 00:17:58,040
Engage, short circuit.

311
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:02,860
You see, unlike humans,
machines follow commands.

312
00:18:03,780 --> 00:18:05,320
Hey, what gives?

313
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:07,320
I'm afraid to find out.

314
00:18:07,860 --> 00:18:10,160
If you haven't already figured it out,

315
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:12,957
this magic card gives
me the power to change

316
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:15,960
all of your monsters from
defense to attack mode.

317
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:18,866
So once again, your life
points are in danger.

318
00:18:19,680 --> 00:18:21,357
Man, I hate this guy.

319
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:25,157
He never lost control of this
match for a second now witness

320
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:28,980
the triumph of machine over
Matt or should I say female?

321
00:18:29,260 --> 00:18:33,180
Machine King prepare to attack
her forgiving maiden now

322
00:18:34,420 --> 00:18:35,760
Serenity no

323
00:18:36,580 --> 00:18:37,960
She'll lose the duel.

324
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:40,757
There's got to be something
I can do to save her,

325
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:46,060
but what I got it I can use my deck
master to intercept his attack go No!

326
00:18:46,300 --> 00:18:49,160
Super Roboyaro! No! Tristan!

327
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:51,717
If your Deckmaster's destroyed, you lose!

328
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:55,741
My monster's special ability allows
me to play this card face down!

329
00:18:56,100 --> 00:18:57,806
Then its attack points go up!

330
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:59,740
Not by enough, you fool!

331
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:04,040
Your monster has sadly
become last year's model!

332
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:09,120
When the Deckmaster is
destroyed, so is the duelist!

333
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:12,660
I'm aware of that, you
oversized trash can!

334
00:19:12,940 --> 00:19:15,060
Okay, no more lies.

335
00:19:15,980 --> 00:19:17,937
I'm not the duelist you think I am.

336
00:19:18,020 --> 00:19:19,902
I didn't teach Joey how to play.

337
00:19:20,100 --> 00:19:22,580
I hardly know the basics of duel monsters.

338
00:19:23,780 --> 00:19:26,540
And you, you better take care of her.

339
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:31,040
You've lost the duel, so it's
time for you to go down there.

340
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:32,760
Oh, no, Tristan!

341
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:38,700
Please come back! No!

342
00:19:40,020 --> 00:19:40,940
Where'd he go?

343
00:19:41,580 --> 00:19:44,697
He said we'd only fall
if we cheated. Relax.

344
00:19:44,780 --> 00:19:47,817
His mind has been
digitized and his body is

345
00:19:47,900 --> 00:19:50,337
in a holding area
waiting to be taken over.

346
00:19:50,420 --> 00:19:53,380
And you'll both join him soon enough.
